---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="BAC refund policy" description="Refunds for BORGAS Asset Creator licenses: 14 days, and how a refund ends the license.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap reading">
      <p class="eyebrow">BORGAS Asset Creator / Order policies</p>
      <h1>Refund policy.</h1>
      <p>Updated September 23, 2026. This policy covers BORGAS Asset Creator (BAC) licenses sold by Devin Tague, doing business as BORGAS. Physical products follow the <a href="/shipping-returns/">shipping and return policy</a>.</p>
      <p>BAC runs on your own hardware, so please check the <a href="/products/asset-creator/">system requirements</a> before buying. Here's exactly how refunds work.</p>

      <h2>14 days if it won't run on your computer</h2>
      <p>If BAC won't install, set up or generate on your computer within 14 days of purchase, email <a href="mailto:hello@borgas.us">hello@borgas.us</a> with your order number and a short description of what happened. We'll try to fix it first. If we can't get it working within a reasonable time, we'll refund you in full.</p>

      <h2>Changed your mind</h2>
      <p>Within 14 days of purchase, if you haven't generated anything with BAC, we'll refund you in full for any reason.</p>

      <h2>Other requests</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>After you've used BAC to make models,</strong> we don't generally refund for dissatisfaction with individual results, since AI-generated models vary from run to run. Contact us anyway. We'll help you get better results and consider any request fairly.</li>
        <li><strong>After 14 days,</strong> no refunds, except where the law requires one.</li>
        <li><strong>Duplicate or accidental purchases</strong> are refunded in full at any time.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How refunds work</h2>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@borgas.us">hello@borgas.us</a> from the address you used at checkout, with your order number. We reply within 2 business days. Approved refunds go back to your original payment method through PayPal, usually within 5–10 business days.</p>
      <p>When a purchase is refunded, the license ends and its key is revoked: BAC stops generating, finishing, exporting and running QA the next time it goes online. Please uninstall BAC.</p>

      <h2>Launch price</h2>
      <p>The launch price applies to the first 100 licenses sold. A refunded launch-price purchase still counts toward those 100 and doesn't reserve a launch-price spot for a later purchase.</p>

      <h2>Chargebacks</h2>
      <p>If you have a problem, please contact us before disputing a payment with PayPal or your bank. It's faster for you. A charged-back purchase ends the license.</p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Write to <a href="mailto:hello@borgas.us">hello@borgas.us</a>. Your use of BAC is also covered by the <a href="/bac/license/">license agreement</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
